@page "/terms"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Terms of Service";
    ViewData["Nav"] = "terms";
}
<h1 class="title">@T["Terms_Title"]</h1>
<p class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">@T["Terms_Subtitle"]</p>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">1. Non-Commercial Fan Project Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>
        <strong>ELX11 (Evolution Legacy X 11)</strong> is an independent, non-commercial, fan-made preservation project dedicated to keeping the online multiplayer nostalgia of Pro Evolution Soccer 2011 alive. 
    </p>
    <p>
        <em>Pro Evolution Soccer</em>, <em>PES</em>, and all associated names, logos, and game assets are registered trademarks and copyright of <strong>Konami Digital Entertainment Co., Ltd.</strong> 
        ELX11 is not affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or associated with Konami in any capacity. This service is completely free, does not accept payments, sells no virtual goods, and operates strictly under fair use principles for educational and digital preservation purposes.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">2. Account Creation & Eligibility</h2>
    <p>
        To access online features, players must register an account with a unique Game ID and password. You agree to:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li>Provide your own legally obtained copy of Pro Evolution Soccer 2011 (PC).</li>
        <li>Maintain the security and confidentiality of your credentials.</li>
        <li>Not share, sell, transfer, or auction your account to third parties.</li>
        <li>Not create automated accounts, bots, or spam accounts.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">3. Fair Play & Anti-Cheating Code</h2>
    <p>
        Competitive integrity is the foundation of ELX11. The following behaviors are strictly prohibited and will result in immediate suspension or permanent ban:
    </p>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Cheating & Memory Tampering:</strong> Use of external injectors, memory editors, speedhacks, modified binary executables, or gameplay manipulation tools.</li>
        <li><strong>Param Tampering:</strong> Altering in-game database/parameter files to gain unfair speed, stamina, or player attribute advantages. Matchmaking enforces parameter hash verification.</li>
        <li><strong>Match Manipulation:</strong> Deliberate disconnection (lag-switching, rage-quitting to avoid rating loss), win-trading, or match collusion.</li>
        <li><strong>Toxic Conduct:</strong> Hate speech, harassment, abusive language, discriminatory remarks, or offensive player/avatar names in lobbies or chat channels.</li>
    </ul>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="margin-bottom: 24px; padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">4. Service Availability & Modifications</h2>
    <p>
        The ELX11 online service is provided on an <strong>"as-is"</strong> and <strong>"as-available"</strong> basis without warranties of any kind. 
        We reserve the right to perform server maintenance, roll out updates, reset seasonal ranking points, or modify game lobby configurations at any time.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="panel" style="padding: 24px; line-height: 1.7;">
    <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">5. Account Termination</h2>
    <p>
        We reserve the right to terminate, suspend, or restrict access to any account that violates these Terms of Service or threatens the security, stability, or enjoyment of the ELX11 community.
    </p>
</section>
